<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.label.reads ~ list local realm labels, wiki placements and bag placements

A list reads local labels, their wikis, canon realm ids and bags; a missing id may read as unread. The address stays a candidate until the operator reads the list.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=` ~ list local realm labels, wiki placements and bag placements`>>
```

